 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e722_312.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那只Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ，\n只在{F2 01 03 01}我们与它面对面地前后移动{F2 01 01 01}时，\n才会向前走。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
